[after 2 seconds]
"You're a real loser. I hope you understand that you are perhaps, the most confounding barbarian I've ever had the displeasure of encountering. Our meeting is servant only to your fortunes, and what a sad affair they are."

[after 4 seconds]
You stifle a groan as you {glink: "Behind You", label: "about to face the man you know is behind you", lookAt: "/root/Start/Agamemnon", moveTo: "e:DeckCenter", clickLook: true}.

:: Behind You
"There is a sickness about you," Agamemnon continues, "a kind of stifling miasma. Certainly not compared to what the Discus was when it was blessed by the Gods. Thor himself smashed {glink: "Mjolnir", label: "that very table", lookAt: "e:DeckRight"} with Mjölinr itself."

:: Mjolnir

[["There's no table there."->Mean]]

[["You make it sound so... exciting."->Mean]]

:: Mean
[JavaScript]
Interactions.cameraFocus("/root/Start/Agamemnon", true);

[cont]

"I aim to say that *warriors* once graced this hall. Now there is only you, and there is only me."

[cont]

"I'm sure you can understand my disappointment with your tenure. It's a betrayal not too dissimilar in feeling to when Aegisthus stabbed me in the back."